    - target: {fileID: 7840051006733746589, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Offset.x
      value: -0.10448408
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7840051006733746589, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Offset.y
      value: 0.28813314
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7840051006733746589, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_SpriteTilingProperty.oldSize.x
      value: 5.44
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7840051006733746589, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_SpriteTilingProperty.oldSize.y
      value: 6.61
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8282435382529470039, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueUI
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 188813552}
    - target: {fileID: 8282435382529470039, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: closingLine.text
      value: 'I shall say only this: never cease moving. You shall find it considerably
        easier to survive if you keep yourself in motion.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8282435382529470039, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8282435382529470039, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: A very good day to you, traveller. I do hope your journey has been a
        most pleasant one. There are rather a great many monsters lurking in these
        parts, you know
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8282435382529470039, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Pardon me? You say you have met someone akin to myself? Surely you cannot
        mean my brother?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8282435382529470039, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: 'Oh, I am positively beside myself with joy! What splendid tidings you
        bring me!. Then that means the Crimson Beast has been vanquished! I must
        depart at once in search of my long-lost kin. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8282435382529470039, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4].text
      value: However, before I do, I should very much like to offer you a word of
        advice.. There is a great beast here as well, you see. A crystalline monstrosity,
        possessed of the dreadful power to summon countless perilous crystals.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8282435382529470039, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3].sound
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2a909d225a5afea41962f6d738bd4ce6, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 8282435382529470039, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4].sound
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2a909d225a5afea41962f6d738bd4ce6, type: 3}
